# Varuna Point Remade's fuel-spill gallery without a suit (CIPlay varuna_point_remade_acid, 11-12 w13, re-cut 11-16 into the knoll; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe: the spoil knoll at 26 -45 (b 12, h 14) on the flat below Varuna's Back; the adit from its mouth
# at 26 -31.5 level into the knoll to 26 -42.5, its end room to 26 -47.5; the side gallery (acid, own plays) leaves it at
# the room's right wall at 28 -41.5 to 29.5 -43.5 and its chamber to 29.8 -46 (zone vp_fuelspill at 29.7 -44.9, r 2.6,
# safe=suit). Floor 2.1 m. (11-16: first cut to 32 -38.5 it broke out of the knoll's flank; then 27 -39 -> 31.8 -45 left
# loose rim rock on the steep flank; now within 6 m of the knoll's heart.) The sign vpfuelwarn at 25 -35.4, suit box 25 -37.4.
island Varuna Point Remade keep
offset -0.7444 -5.052
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown vpfuelacid
walk 26 -28 to 26 -31.5 to 26 -34 below=14
picture vp_acid_sign 26.6 3.9 -32.4 25 2.8 -35.4 light=20
read FUEL WORKS - SIDE GALLERY
walk 26 -34 to 26 -38.5 to 26.8 -41 to 28.4 -42.4 to 29.6 -44.6
wait 8
expect message spilt fuel salts
expect hurt 10
walk 29.6 -44.6 to 28.4 -42.4 to 26.8 -41 to 26 -38.5 to 26 -31.5 to 26 -28
wait 2
expect hurt 1
